      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHASING KISSES (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with seven wins and three minors from 11 tries. In the money last time at this track (17.04) in a Free For All, finishing a half a length second. Looks suited here and rates on top. OLD FRIENDS (8) jumps from box 8 for the first time after scoring at this track (17.17) in a Grade 5. Strike rate this distance strong having won two of four tries. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Has put together a string of wins and expected to go close again. BECKY BELLE (1) had been racing well prior to her last start seventh at this track following a Grade 5 win three back with a third placing. Can hit the frame this time. FLIP FLOP (5) recorded a 2.25 lengths win (17.32) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Yet to taste defeat in two runs from this draw.",
